{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.poster.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.webm?t=1765489886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a Thief or a Guard?\u00a0Choose your side and try to outsmart your opponents with your plans! Use your role, watch your surroundings, and wait for the right moment \u2014 but be careful, your time is limited! What you do within the time limit will determine your fate. Remember, only one side wins the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/0926bcf1ec485fc722703c92db016423.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal as many valuables as you can before time runs out, stay low-key, and escape without getting caught by the guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bandit shares a common ability: <strong>Disguise!</strong> Blend into the crowd and act like one of them. If you\u2019re spotted, use your skills to escape!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, You are a team! Each of you has a unique role \u2014 create the right combos as a team and confuse the guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/c38202e8a55c6a2e5cb576e2982e617e.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Guard, you have one mission: <strong>Protect the Treasure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has already called in the troops, and the thieves are on a timer. Your goal is to stop the heist within this limited time and, if possible, capture the thieves!\u00a0But be careful \u2014 harming innocents can have irreversible consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role wisely! Each role has unique abilities and strategies. Pick the role that best suits your playstyle and prevent the thieves from escaping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/8a137d779f28ca64ea70f28959350536.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure, which begins in the medieval era, is about to expand with brand-new themes! Different eras, different locations. Who knows when and where the thieves will strike next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/39d81491365533c54531f2ba95eee44a.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Roles to Diversify the Gameplay!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thieves Don\u2019t Have Ten Hands: Inventory Management!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard-Exclusive Emergency Mechanic!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Themes, New Maps! (Coming Soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heists at Different Times! (How About a Night Heist?)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Play for Thieves!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Strategy-Focused Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321300?t=1765489886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321300?t=1765489886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/a536742d467cdb418c25b6b03f036f6651285578/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765489886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/a536742d467cdb418c25b6b03f036f6651285578/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765489886","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.poster.avif?t=1765489886\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321300/extras/d06a6fe9317ec372adfcf5214f1cb9d7.webm?t=1765489886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a Thief or a Guard?\u00a0Choose your side and try to outsmart your opponents with your plans! Use your role, watch your surroundings, and wait for the right moment \u2014 but be careful, your time is limited! What you do within the time limit will determine your fate. Remember, only one side wins the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass